flowchart TB
  U[Analyst / UI] --> FE[Streamlit dashboard]
  U2[Service client] --> API[FastAPI /ask]
  FE --> ORCH[Bounded agent orchestrator]
  API --> ORCH
  ORCH --> G{Policy / analytics intent router}
  G --> RAG[Policy retrieval tool]
  G --> MET[Energy metrics tool]
  G --> SIM[Scenario tool]
  G --> MKT[Market snapshot tool]
  RAG --> IDX[TF-IDF index + source metadata]
  IDX --> DOCS[(Energy policy briefs)]
  ORCH --> AUD[(SQLite audit ledger)]
  AUD --> DASH[Run, latency, tool-order and cost dashboard]
  PIPE[Prefect ingestion flow] --> IDX
  PIPE --> DQ[Corpus validation + checksums]
